  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Subsidy application Bangladesh 2026-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the Orange Corners Grant Programme is to offer training and support to young entrepreneurs aged between 18 to 35 years old, so they can turn their ideas into businesses with sustainable revenue models.The grant programme places particular focus on women entrepreneurs and entrepreneurs whose business operations will contribute to the Sustainable Development Goals.The secondary objectives are:&#x2022;	Raising awareness of entrepreneurship and encouraging young people&apos;s entrepreneurial spirit and skills; and&#x2022;	Strengthening the capacity of local businesses and local civil society organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
